"""Policy templates of «مركز وعد للمعرفة». Each: slug, ar/en title, purpose, scope, provisions, procedures, responsibilities, refs.
Provisions restate the Labor Law where cited (official consolidated text, hrsd.gov.sa, May 2025); everything else is a sound
default the company adapts. Every policy must agree with the company's approved work regulations (لائحة تنظيم العمل)."""

def P(slug, ar, en, purpose, scope, prov, proc, resp, refs):
    return dict(slug=slug, ar=ar, en=en, purpose=purpose, scope=scope, prov=prov, proc=proc, resp=resp, refs=refs)

